[[SECTION]]
UID: MEMBERS-OBJECTIVES
TITLE: Member's Functions

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-18
TITLE: Member Elections
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should support elections by the membership for GSSC leadership.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
GSSC elections should be digitized and accessible.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-19
TITLE: Member Publications
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should support publications by the membership.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
GSSC publications should be streamlined without requiring developer intervention.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: DEVELOPMENT-OBJECTIVES
TITLE: Development Objectives

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-1
TITLE: Public Domain
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should have a public facing primary domain.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Guests, visitors, and interested persons should be able to learn more about the GSSC.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-2
TITLE: Member Subdomain
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should have a members-only subdomain.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Members of the GSSC should have an internal area where they can manage their memberships, access members-only resources, and perform private actions related to the GSSC.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-3
TITLE: Unified Backend
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should have a unified backend supporting the public and members-only spaces.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This will enable changes to the public domain to be made from the members-only area by members with sufficient permissions. It will allow for content to be shared between the two spaces without duplication.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-4
TITLE: Website Security
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should be secure.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An unsecure site poses a risk to the consumers of the site.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-5
TITLE: Maintainer Useability
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should be modifiable by individuals without programming knowledge.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This will reduce load on the developers by empowering the owners to make changes they desire at will.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-6
TITLE: Multiuser Support
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should be modifiable by multiple users at once.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This will reduce load on the developers by empowering the owners to make changes they desire at will.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-7
TITLE: Member-Driven Content
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should dynamically create content which may be user driven.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Pages which could be generated by users, such as new publications, newsletters, events, etc. should not require developer intervention.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]
